"211304":{"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e45d86","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx211304-PItzmt5h2yMC.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx211304-PItzmt5h2yMC.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx211304-PItzmt5h2yMC.jpg"},"description":"Momose has always longed for a peaceful high school life. She wants nothing to do with hoodlums, delinquents, or troublemakers. When she meets Ichikura, an inconspicuous black-haired boy with glasses, he looks like a normal, nice guy. But it turns out that back in junior high he was a nefarious delinquent! He keeps assuring her that he’s changed his ways, but he still has a knack for picking fights! Has Ichikura really turned over a new leaf? And will Momose keep the secret about his rowdy past?\n<br><br>\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)","favourites":84,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"hashtag":"#メガネ時々ヤンキーくん","id":211304,"idMal":64006,"isAdult":false,"isLicensed":true,"popularity":6196,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2027,"source":"MANGA","startDate":{"month":4,"year":2027},"status":"NOT_YET_RELEASED","studios":[{"id":318,"name":"WAO World"},{"id":6170,"name":"Studio Flad"}],"synonyms":["Otasukebu","Glasses With a Chance of Delinquent"],"tags":[{"id":53,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Shoujo","rank":60},{"id":1045,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Heterosexual","rank":60},{"id":46,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"School","rank":60},{"id":1228,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":60},{"id":395,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Delinquents","rank":50}],"title":{"native":"メガネ、時々、ヤンキーくん","romaji":"Megane, Tokidoki, Yankee-kun"},"trailer":{"id":"_NDtGmyPz1w","site":"youtube"},"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793203253},
"211308":{"averageScore":66,"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/211308-4RLMAhvtMh68.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e42843","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx211308-KG8w6IyCI3r0.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx211308-KG8w6IyCI3r0.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx211308-KG8w6IyCI3r0.png"},"description":"Princess Sapphire of the lost kingdom. Stripped of everything in her homeland, Silverland, by the calamity known as \"Nergal,\" she arrived in Goldland at the very depths of despair. While carrying the weight of her past, she began to find a glimmer of hope through the kindness of the people. Yet, as if mocking her peaceful daily life, the calamity \"Nergal\" appears once more. The same despair that reduced her homeland to ashes is now threatening to steal the light from this land as well.<br><br>\n<i>\"No more loss for me. No more loss for anyone.”</i> <br><br>Wiping way her fears of sorrow, the young girl takes up her sword. <br>This is the story of a hero who ties her ribbon and resolves to defy fate. <br><br>\n\n(Source: THE RIBBON HERO Official Site)\n<br><br>\n\n<i> Note: This anime is inspired by Osamu Tezuka's manga \"Princess Knight”.","duration":109,"endDate":{"day":8,"month":8,"year":2026},"episodes":1,"favourites":198,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Fantasy","Mahou Shoujo"],"hashtag":"#RIBBONHERO #リボンヒーロー","id":211308,"idMal":64012,"isAdult":false,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":66,"popularity":16908,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"startDate":{"day":8,"month":8,"year":2026},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"id":6912,"name":"OUTLINE"}],"synonyms":["リボンへーロー","La heroína del lazo","เดอะริบบิ้นฮีโร่","A Heroína da Fita","Герой ленты","L'Héroïne au ruban"],"tags":[{"id":98,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":91},{"id":172,"isMediaSpoiler":fals